---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n';
import { localePath } from '../../i18n';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;
const p = (path: string) => localePath(locale, path);

const gdr = {
  rounds: 160,
  rollouts: 20480,
  candidates: 44,
  accepted: 7,
  acceptanceRate: '15.9%',
  post49Candidates: 16,
  post49Accepted: 0,
};
const snapshot = {
  verifiedAt: '2026-09-07T04:28:35Z',
  completedRounds: 15,
  rollouts: 1920,
  totalRollouts: 20480,
  gdrProbeCalls: 0,
  acceptanceEvaluations: 0,
  execution: '90fa6eb4',
};
const controls = zh ? [
  ['Base model', 'Qwen3-1.7B', '相同'],
  ['Stage1 lineage', '同一封存 lineage', '相同'],
  ['Harness', '201.1', '相同'],
  ['Sampling', '同一冻结配置', '相同'],
  ['Task / seed policy', '同一 schedule + injective seed policy', '相同'],
  ['每轮预算', '128 rollouts', '相同'],
  ['总预算', '160 rounds = 20,480 rollouts', '相同'],
  ['Memory / Skill / Agent / SD-LoRA', '同一机制与容量合同', '相同'],
  ['Final panel', '训练期间隔离', '相同'],
  ['External teacher calls', '0', '相同'],
  ['Candidate transition policy', 'GDR-v1：probe 后 Accept / Reject；DirectApply：通过工程合同后直接进入下一状态', '唯一主要 treatment'],
] : [
  ['Base model', 'Qwen3-1.7B', 'Matched'],
  ['Stage-1 lineage', 'Same sealed lineage', 'Matched'],
  ['Harness', '201.1', 'Matched'],
  ['Sampling', 'Same frozen configuration', 'Matched'],
  ['Task / seed policy', 'Same schedule + injective seed policy', 'Matched'],
  ['Per-round budget', '128 rollouts', 'Matched'],
  ['Total budget', '160 rounds = 20,480 rollouts', 'Matched'],
  ['Memory / Skill / Agent / SD-LoRA', 'Same mechanisms and capacity contract', 'Matched'],
  ['Final panel', 'Isolated during training', 'Matched'],
  ['External teacher calls', '0', 'Matched'],
  ['Candidate transition policy', 'GDR-v1: probe then Accept / Reject; DirectApply: apply after engineering contracts pass', 'Primary treatment'],
];
const safetyChecks = zh ? [
  'artifact integrity', 'dataset contract', 'action / schema contract', 'capacity limit',
  'SD training success', 'execution identity', 'rollout denominator', 'final-panel isolation',
] : [
  'artifact integrity', 'dataset contract', 'action / schema contract', 'capacity limit',
  'SD training success', 'execution identity', 'rollout denominator', 'final-panel isolation',
];
const known = zh ? [
  '1.7B GDR-v1 产生了 44 个 SD-LoRA candidate，远多于 7 次正式更新。',
  '只有 7 个 SD-LoRA candidate 被 GDR 接受并进入后续模型状态。',
  'R49 之后又产生 16 个 SD-LoRA candidate，但 0 个被接受。',
  'DirectApply 的 transition 不调用 GDR task-score probe；当前已完成轮次的 probe_calls 与 acceptance_evaluations 都是 0。',
  'DirectApply R0 与 GDR R0 的 128 个 rollout case 在 seed、raw completion、action trajectory、reward 与 invalid 上逐一匹配。',
  'No-GDR 实验已经启动；当前运行状态只是中途快照，不是最终科学结果。',
] : [
  'The 1.7B GDR-v1 run produced 44 SD-LoRA candidates, far more than seven formal updates.',
  'Only seven SD-LoRA candidates were accepted by GDR and entered the successor model state.',
  'After R49, 16 more SD-LoRA candidates were produced and none were accepted.',
  'DirectApply transitions do not call the GDR task-score probe; completed rounds currently record zero probe calls and zero acceptance evaluations.',
  'DirectApply R0 matches GDR R0 case-by-case across 128 rollout cases for seeds, raw completions, action trajectories, rewards, and invalid status.',
  'The No-GDR run has started; the live state shown here is an interim snapshot, not a final scientific result.',
];
const unknown = zh ? [
  'GDR 是否降低 160 rounds 后的最终性能。',
  'DirectApply 是否最终优于 GDR-v1。',
  '被 GDR 拒绝的 candidate 是否本来就是“好 candidate”。',
  '更多 SD-LoRA updates 是否一定带来更高 final score。',
  '未来的 GDR-v2 是否会优于 GDR-v1 或 DirectApply。',
] : [
  'Whether GDR lowers final performance after 160 rounds.',
  'Whether DirectApply ultimately beats GDR-v1.',
  'Whether rejected candidates were actually “good candidates.”',
  'Whether more SD-LoRA updates necessarily yield a higher final score.',
  'Whether a future GDR-v2 would beat GDR-v1 or DirectApply.',
];
---

<article data-copy-review class="gdr-page" data-testid="gdr-directapply-page" data-ui-audit="contrast layout" data-reader-page="research-explainer">
  <header class="gdr-hero" id="top">
    <a class="gdr-back" href={p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/')}>← {t('OpenEvo 能力探索', 'OpenEvo capability exploration')}</a>
    <p class="gdr-eyebrow">OPENEVO × WEBSHOP · GDR → DIRECTAPPLY</p>
    <h1>{t('为什么 44 次学习尝试，最后只让 7 次进入模型？', 'Why did 44 learning attempts become only 7 model updates?')}</h1>
    <p class="gdr-lede">{t(
      '我们发现，Qwen3-1.7B 的 Stage2 并不是只训练了 7 次 SD-LoRA。它实际产生了 44 个 SD-LoRA candidate，但旧版 GDR 会先让每个新状态参加一个 16-task 小考试；只要关键指标出现退步，就继续使用旧状态。这个现象让我们提出一个新的对照：如果不让短期分数决定 candidate 能否继续学习，会发生什么？',
      'Qwen3-1.7B did not train SD-LoRA only seven times. Stage 2 produced 44 SD-LoRA candidates, but GDR-v1 first gave each changed state a 16-task probe and kept the old state whenever key metrics regressed. That raised a new ablation question: what happens if short-horizon task score no longer decides whether a candidate may continue learning?'
    )}</p>
    <dl class="gdr-glossary" aria-label={t('第一次阅读术语', 'First-read glossary')}>
      <div><dt>GDR · GatedDeltaRule</dt><dd>{t('新状态的放行规则：先做一个小 probe，再决定保留新状态还是退回旧状态。', 'A transition rule: probe a changed state first, then keep it or fall back to the incumbent.')}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>SD-LoRA</dt><dd>{t('一次小型参数学习得到的 adapter candidate；candidate 被训练出来，不等于已经被正式采用。', 'A small trainable adapter candidate; producing it does not mean it has been formally adopted.')}</dd></div>
    </dl>

    <div class="gdr-answer" role="note">
      <span>{t('先记住这一句', 'The one sentence to remember')}</span>
      <strong>{t('44 次尝试学习 → GDR 小考试 → 7 次正式进入模型状态', '44 learning attempts → GDR probe → 7 entered the model state')}</strong>
      <p>{t('所以「7 次 UPDATE」≠「只训练了 7 次 SD-LoRA」。', 'So “7 updates” does not mean “SD-LoRA trained only seven times.”')} <code>44 candidates → 7 updates</code></p>
    </div>

    <dl class="gdr-metrics" aria-label={t('GDR-v1 核心数字', 'GDR-v1 key numbers')}>
      <div><dt>Stage2 rounds</dt><dd>{gdr.rounds}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Formal rollouts</dt><dd>{gdr.rollouts.toLocaleString('en-US')}</dd></div>
      <div class="is-candidate"><dt>SD-LoRA candidates</dt><dd>{gdr.candidates}</dd></div>
      <div class="is-accepted"><dt>{t('正式 SD UPDATE', 'Formal SD updates')}</dt><dd>{gdr.accepted}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Acceptance rate</dt><dd>{gdr.acceptanceRate}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('R49 后', 'After R49')}</dt><dd>{gdr.post49Candidates} → {gdr.post49Accepted}</dd></div>
    </dl>

    <figure class="gdr-funnel" data-testid="gdr-44-to-7-funnel">
      <div class="gdr-funnel__candidate"><b>44</b><span>{t('SD-LoRA candidate 训练尝试', 'SD-LoRA candidate training attempts')}</span></div>
      <div class="gdr-funnel__gate"><span>GDR-v1</span><small>{t('16-task probe · one-step gate', '16-task probe · one-step gate')}</small></div>
      <div class="gdr-funnel__accepted"><b>7</b><span>{t('进入后续模型状态', 'entered successor model state')}</span></div>
      <figcaption>{t('R49 时累计 28 candidates / 7 accepted；最终 44 / 7。因此 R49 后新增 16 candidates，接受数没有再增加。', 'At R49 the cumulative count was 28 candidates / 7 accepted; the sealed run ended at 44 / 7. Thus 16 additional candidates appeared after R49 and none were accepted.')}</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="gdr-live" data-testid="directapply-live-snapshot">
      <span class="gdr-live__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div><strong>{t('DirectApply / No-GDR 已启动', 'DirectApply / No-GDR has started')}</strong><p>{t(`上次核验：${snapshot.completedRounds}/160 rounds 完成，${snapshot.rollouts.toLocaleString('en-US')}/${snapshot.totalRollouts.toLocaleString('en-US')} rollouts。这里不是最终结果。`, `Last verified: ${snapshot.completedRounds}/160 rounds complete, ${snapshot.rollouts.toLocaleString('en-US')}/${snapshot.totalRollouts.toLocaleString('en-US')} rollouts. This is not a final result.`)}</p></div>
      <time datetime={snapshot.verifiedAt}>{snapshot.verifiedAt.replace('T', ' ').replace('Z', ' UTC')}</time>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="gdr-section" id="two-policies" aria-labelledby="two-policies-title">
    <p class="gdr-so-what">{t('所以呢？我们不是把 GDR「调松」，而是专门做一个不使用 task-score acceptance gate 的独立 treatment。', 'So what? We did not merely “loosen” GDR. We created a separate treatment with no task-score acceptance gate.')}</p>
    <h2 id="two-policies-title">{t('同样学习，只有「candidate 怎么进入下一状态」不同', 'Same learning pipeline; only the candidate transition rule changes')}</h2>
    <div class="gdr-flow-compare">
      <figure class="gdr-flow is-gdr">
        <figcaption><b>GDR-v1</b><span>{t('hard one-step monotonic gate', 'hard one-step monotonic gate')}</span></figcaption>
        <ol>
          <li><span>1</span><div><strong>Rollout</strong><small>{t('每轮 128 次 WebShop 尝试', '128 WebShop attempts per round')}</small></div></li>
          <li><span>2</span><div><strong>{t('生成 candidate', 'Generate candidate')}</strong><small>Memory / Skill / Agent / SD-LoRA</small></div></li>
          <li class="is-gate"><span>3</span><div><strong>16-task probe</strong><small>exact / positive / mean / invalid</small></div></li>
          <li><span>4</span><div><strong>Accept / Reject</strong><small>{t('所有 non-regression 成立，且至少一项严格改善才接受', 'Accept only if every non-regression check passes and at least one task metric strictly improves')}</small></div></li>
          <li><span>5</span><div><strong>{t('Reject → 继续旧状态', 'Reject → keep incumbent')}</strong><small>{t('challenger 不进入下一轮', 'challenger does not enter the next round')}</small></div></li>
        </ol>
      </figure>
      <figure class="gdr-flow is-direct">
        <figcaption><b>DirectApply / No-GDR</b><span>{t('independent ablation', 'independent ablation')}</span></figcaption>
        <ol>
          <li><span>1</span><div><strong>Rollout</strong><small>{t('同样每轮 128 次 WebShop 尝试', 'the same 128 WebShop attempts per round')}</small></div></li>
          <li><span>2</span><div><strong>{t('生成 candidate', 'Generate candidate')}</strong><small>Memory / Skill / Agent / SD-LoRA</small></div></li>
          <li class="is-contract"><span>3</span><div><strong>{t('工程 / 数据合同', 'Engineering / data contracts')}</strong><small>{t('身份、schema、训练成功、容量等仍然 fail-closed', 'identity, schema, training success, capacity, etc. remain fail-closed')}</small></div></li>
          <li><span>4</span><div><strong>DirectApply</strong><small>{t('通过合同的 changed candidate 直接成为下一状态', 'a changed candidate that passes contracts becomes the next state')}</small></div></li>
          <li><span>5</span><div><strong>{t('继续学习', 'Continue learning')}</strong><small>{t('不再用短期 task score 决定生死', 'short-term task score no longer decides survival')}</small></div></li>
        </ol>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <aside class="gdr-safety" data-testid="no-gdr-not-no-safety">
      <div><span>✓</span><strong>No-GDR ≠ No Safety</strong></div>
      <p>{t('删除的只有：根据短期 task-score probe 决定 candidate 是否可以进入下一状态。下面这些合同继续保留：', 'Only one thing is removed: using a short-horizon task-score probe to decide whether a candidate may enter the next state. These contracts remain:')}</p>
      <ul>{safetyChecks.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section class="gdr-section" id="why-question-gdr" aria-labelledby="why-question-gdr-title">
    <p class="gdr-so-what">{t('所以呢？GDR-v1 的问题不是「有 gate」本身，而是它用一步之后的结果，替 160 轮之后的目标做决定。', 'So what? The issue is not simply that GDR has a gate; it lets a one-step result decide for a 160-round objective.')}</p>
    <h2 id="why-question-gdr-title">{t('为什么我们开始怀疑 GDR-v1 太保守？', 'Why did we begin to suspect GDR-v1 was too conservative?')}</h2>
    <div class="gdr-problems">
      <article><span>01</span><h3>Myopic objective</h3><p>{t('真正的问题是「160 rounds 后模型有多好？」；GDR-v1 实际问的是「这个 candidate 下一步是不是立刻不变差，而且至少一项更好？」两者不是同一个目标。', 'The real objective is “how good is the model after 160 rounds?” GDR-v1 instead asks whether this candidate is immediately non-worse on every metric and strictly better on at least one. Those are different objectives.')}</p></article>
      <article><span>02</span><h3>{t('小 probe 的离散噪声', 'Discrete noise in a small probe')}</h3><p>{t('probe 只有 16 tasks。2/16 → 1/16 只少一题，却会被 hard non-regression rule 看成明显 exact regression。小 panel 的单题波动很容易触发 veto。', 'The probe contains only 16 tasks. A 2/16 → 1/16 shift is one task, yet a hard non-regression rule treats it as an exact-success regression. One discrete task can therefore trigger a veto.')}</p></article>
      <article><span>03</span><h3>{t('Carrier attribution', 'Carrier attribution')}</h3><p>{t('Memory、Skill、Agent、SD-LoRA 组成同一个 candidate state 再整体评价。因此「整体 candidate 变差」不能直接推出「SD-LoRA delta 本身变差」。', 'Memory, Skill, Agent and SD-LoRA form one candidate state and are evaluated together. A worse combined candidate does not identify the SD-LoRA delta itself as the cause.')}</p></article>
      <article><span>04</span><h3>{t('探索被提前截断', 'Exploration is truncated')}</h3><p>{t('challenger 在 t 时刻可能比 incumbent 差，但沿同一方向继续几轮后可能反超。GDR-v1 在 t 就把它删除，因此永远观察不到 t+3 / t+5。', 'A challenger can be worse at t yet become better after several more steps along the same path. GDR-v1 deletes it at t, so t+3 or t+5 is never observed.')}</p></article>
    </div>

    <figure class="gdr-horizon" data-testid="long-horizon-trajectory">
      <div class="gdr-horizon__chart">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 760 300" role="img">
          <title>{t('概念图：challenger 先下降，之后可能超过 incumbent', 'Concept: challenger dips before potentially overtaking incumbent')}</title>
          <line x1="70" y1="245" x2="720" y2="245" class="axis"/><line x1="70" y1="245" x2="70" y2="35" class="axis"/>
          <line x1="70" y1="150" x2="720" y2="150" class="incumbent"/>
          <path d="M110 176 C180 190 230 206 290 188 S405 130 470 112 S590 82 680 68" class="challenger"/>
          <circle cx="110" cy="176" r="7" class="point p1"/><circle cx="290" cy="188" r="7" class="point p2"/><circle cx="470" cy="112" r="7" class="point p3"/><circle cx="680" cy="68" r="7" class="point p4"/>
          <text x="82" y="140">incumbent</text><text x="105" y="210">t</text><text x="278" y="220">t+1</text><text x="452" y="102">t+3</text><text x="662" y="58">t+5</text>
          <text x="580" y="270">future rounds →</text><text x="24" y="65" transform="rotate(-90 24 65)">score</text>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <figcaption><strong>{t('这是研究动机，不是已观测结果。', 'This is a hypothesis illustration, not an observed result.')}</strong> {t('DirectApply 的目的正是让这条可能的长期路径有机会被真实实验观察，而不是在 t 就假设它一定会成功。', 'DirectApply lets such a long-horizon path become observable; it does not assume that the path will actually succeed.')}</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="gdr-section" id="three-generations" aria-labelledby="three-generations-title">
    <p class="gdr-so-what">{t('所以呢？我们没有回头改掉旧实验。GDR-v1、DirectApply 和未来 GDR-v2 必须是三个不同实验条件。', 'So what? We did not rewrite the old run. GDR-v1, DirectApply, and any future GDR-v2 must remain distinct experimental conditions.')}</p>
    <h2 id="three-generations-title">{t('保留旧条件，新增 ablation，未来再研究新 gate', 'Preserve the old condition, add an ablation, then study a new gate separately')}</h2>
    <div class="gdr-generations">
      <article class="is-history"><span>{t('已完成条件', 'Completed condition')}</span><h3>GDR-v1</h3><p>hard one-step monotonic gate</p><small>{t('不 retroactively 修改', 'Never retroactively modified')}</small></article>
      <div class="gdr-generation-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
      <article class="is-running"><span>{t('当前独立 ablation', 'Current independent ablation')}</span><h3>DirectApply / No-GDR</h3><p>{t('没有 task-score acceptance gate', 'No task-score acceptance gate')}</p><small>{t('已启动 · 未完成', 'Started · incomplete')}</small></article>
      <div class="gdr-generation-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
      <article class="is-future"><span>{t('Future Work', 'Future work')}</span><h3>GDR-v2</h3><p>probation / long-horizon / trust-region style</p><small>{t('Concept · Not Yet Validated', 'Concept · Not Yet Validated')}</small></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gdr-section" id="experiment-design" aria-labelledby="experiment-design-title">
    <p class="gdr-so-what">{t('所以呢？这个实验要回答的不是「能不能多做 update」，而是「candidate transition policy 会不会改变长期学习轨迹」。', 'So what? This experiment is not asking whether we can merely do more updates. It asks whether candidate transition policy changes the long-horizon learning trajectory.')}</p>
    <h2 id="experiment-design-title">{t('DirectApply 对照实验：只动一个主要 treatment', 'DirectApply ablation: change one primary treatment')}</h2>
    <div class="gdr-question"><span>{t('实验问题', 'Scientific question')}</span><strong>{t('GDR 到底是在保护模型免受坏更新，还是在阻止长期有价值的学习路径？', 'Does GDR protect the model from bad updates, or block learning paths that become valuable over a longer horizon?')}</strong></div>
    <div class="gdr-control-table" role="region" aria-label={t('实验控制变量表', 'Experiment controls table')} tabindex="0">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>{t('变量', 'Variable')}</th><th>{t('冻结 / 对齐', 'Frozen / matched')}</th><th>{t('角色', 'Role')}</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>{controls.map(([name, value, role]) => <tr class:list={{ treatment: name === 'Candidate transition policy' }}><th scope="row">{name}</th><td>{value}</td><td>{role}</td></tr>)}</tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gdr-section" id="round0-match" aria-labelledby="round0-match-title">
    <p class="gdr-so-what">{t('Round 0 对齐要求：两组开始使用不同 transition policy 之前，先证明 128 个 episode 的行为起点一致。', 'Round 0 matching requirement: before the two arms use different transition policies, verify that all 128 episodes start from the same behavior.')}</p>
    <h2 id="round0-match-title">{t('Round 0：行为语义匹配，但 adapter 不是 bitwise-identical', 'Round 0: behavior is semantically matched, but the adapter is not bitwise-identical')}</h2>
    <div class="gdr-match-grid" data-testid="round0-semantic-match">
      <div><strong>128 / 128</strong><span>task_id</span><small>{t('一致', 'matched')}</small></div>
      <div><strong>128 / 128</strong><span>rollout + generation seeds</span><small>{t('一致', 'matched')}</small></div>
      <div><strong>128 / 128</strong><span>raw completion</span><small>{t('逐步一致', 'stepwise matched')}</small></div>
      <div><strong>128 / 128</strong><span>action trajectory</span><small>{t('逐步一致', 'stepwise matched')}</small></div>
      <div><strong>128 / 128</strong><span>reward + invalid</span><small>{t('一致', 'matched')}</small></div>
      <div class="is-mean"><strong>0.3364082792207789</strong><span>mean score</span><small>{t('两边完全相同', 'exactly equal')}</small></div>
    </div>
    <div class="gdr-adapter-drift">
      <div><span>{t('GDR-v1 R0 task-vector norm', 'GDR-v1 R0 task-vector norm')}</span><b>0.3315128741</b></div>
      <div><span>{t('DirectApply R0 task-vector norm', 'DirectApply R0 task-vector norm')}</span><b>0.3307554585</b></div>
      <div><span>{t('相对漂移', 'Relative drift')}</span><b>≈ 0.228%</b></div>
      <p>{t('trainer seed 都是 1993，训练数据语义与 OpenEVO Core 相同；但运行 GPU 不同，adapter digest / task-vector norm 没有 bitwise 对齐。因此网页只使用 semantic-matched。', 'Both use trainer seed 1993 with the same dataset semantics and OpenEVO Core, but the training GPU differed and adapter digests / task-vector norms are not bitwise equal. The correct claim is semantic-matched.')}</p>
    </div>
    <p class="gdr-warning"><strong>{t('禁止的说法：', 'Do not say:')}</strong> “the whole experiment is bitwise-identical.”</p>
  </section>

  <section class="gdr-section" id="resource-handoffs" aria-labelledby="resource-handoffs-title">
    <p class="gdr-so-what">{t('所以呢？换 GPU 位置可能只是资源优化；改 worker topology 就已经碰到执行语义。不能只看 Agent 写了一句 scientific_semantics_changed=false。', 'So what? Moving GPU placement can be resource-only; changing worker topology touches execution semantics. An Agent writing scientific_semantics_changed=false is not sufficient evidence.')}</p>
    <h2 id="resource-handoffs-title">{t('实验运行中的 Agent / Ray handoff：哪些能接受，哪些先拒绝', 'Agent / Ray handoffs: what was accepted, and what was held back')}</h2>
    <ol class="gdr-timeline" data-testid="resource-handoff-timeline">
      <li class="is-safe"><span class="gdr-timeline__rail">1</span><div><small>{t('起始执行', 'Source execution')}</small><h3><code>88af1b80</code></h3><p>{t('DirectApply exact-runtime treatment source。transition policy = DIRECT_APPLY_NO_GDR。', 'Exact-runtime DirectApply treatment source. Transition policy = DIRECT_APPLY_NO_GDR.')}</p></div></li>
      <li class="is-safe"><span class="gdr-timeline__rail">2</span><div><small>{t('resource-only successor', 'resource-only successor')}</small><h3><code>d1a0252c</code> → <code>90fa6eb4</code></h3><p>{t('把资源迁移到 GPU0–3，并增加显式 recovery authority / execution lineage。我们检查了实际 diff：design 没变，Harness / sampling / seed / budget / DirectApply policy 没变；formal rollout replay = 0。', 'Moves resources to GPU0–3 and adds explicit recovery authority / execution lineage. We inspected the actual diff: the design, Harness, sampling, seeds, budget and DirectApply policy are unchanged; formal rollout replay = 0.')}</p><b>{t('采用：继续运行', 'ADOPTED')}</b></div></li>
      <li class="is-handoff"><span class="gdr-timeline__rail">3</span><div><small>{t('controller handoff', 'controller handoff')}</small><h3>{t('保留已经启动 / 完成的 rollout', 'Preserve the in-flight / completed rollout')}</h3><p>{t('R5 handoff 只终止 controller，rollout container 继续。R5 最终已有 128/128 attempts；恢复时没有重新消费 formal rollout，直接完成 post-rollout transaction。', 'The R5 handoff terminates only the controller while leaving the rollout container running. R5 ultimately has 128/128 attempts; recovery does not consume the formal rollout again and resumes the post-rollout transaction.')}</p><b>formal_rollout_replay = 0</b></div></li>
      <li class="is-held"><span class="gdr-timeline__rail">4</span><div><small>{t('未经等价验证的 successor', 'unverified-equivalence successor')}</small><h3><code>e47595a0</code> · 4 GPUs × 5 workers/GPU</h3><p>{t('这不是单纯换 GPU：实际 diff 修改了 round driver、launcher、workers_per_gpu、shard layout，并加入 OMP_NUM_THREADS / MKL_NUM_THREADS / TOKENIZERS_PARALLELISM 环境。即使 task 与 seed 不变，也需要先证明行为等价。', 'This is not merely a GPU move. The actual diff changes the round driver, launcher, workers_per_gpu, shard layout, and OMP/MKL/tokenizer thread settings. Even with matched tasks and seeds, behavioral equivalence must be demonstrated first.')}</p><b>{t('未采用：最后核验的正式执行 lineage 仍是 90fa6eb4；5× successor 未获行为等价证明', 'NOT ADOPTED: the last verified formal execution lineage remains 90fa6eb4; the 5× successor lacks behavioral-equivalence evidence')}</b></div></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="gdr-section" id="engineering-lessons" aria-labelledby="engineering-lessons-title">
    <p class="gdr-so-what">{t('所以呢？科研系统里「跑得更快」不是独立于科学问题的。每次 handoff 都要像数据库事务一样可核对。', 'So what? In a scientific system, “run it faster” is not automatically independent of the scientific question. Every handoff needs transaction-like evidence.')}</p>
    <h2 id="engineering-lessons-title">{t('这次留下的六条工程规则', 'Six engineering rules from this incident')}</h2>
    <ol class="gdr-rules">
      <li><b>Resource optimization is not automatically scientifically neutral.</b><p>{t('资源优化必须证明没有改变 scientific semantics，而不是默认中立。', 'Resource optimization must demonstrate semantic neutrality; it cannot assume it.')}</p></li>
      <li><b>{t('Controller handoff 必须是显式事务。', 'Controller handoff must be an explicit transaction.')}</b><p>old SHA · new SHA · state_id · next_round · rollouts_consumed · replay · Harness · sampling · transition policy</p></li>
      <li><b>{t('不要相信标签，要看实际 diff。', 'Do not trust the label; inspect the actual diff.')}</b><p><code>scientific_semantics_changed=false</code> {t('只能是声明，不是证明。', 'is a claim, not proof.')}</p></li>
      <li><b>{t('已有 rollout 不得因为 controller 重启而重复消费。', 'Existing rollouts must not be re-consumed after a controller restart.')}</b><p>{t('恢复点应该识别已经 materialized 的 128/128，再继续 post-rollout。', 'Recovery should recognize the already materialized 128/128 and continue post-rollout.')}</p></li>
      <li><b>{t('历史 receipt 与当前 authority 分开。', 'Historical receipts and current authority are different.')}</b><p>{t('旧 READY 文件存在不代表 Ray pool 仍然 live；必须再检查 heartbeat / liveness。', 'An old READY file does not prove the Ray pool is live; heartbeat / liveness still matters.')}</p></li>
      <li><b>{t('非标准 provenance receipt 不进入 seal 输入目录。', 'Non-standard provenance receipts stay out of seal inputs.')}</b><p>{t('否则可能训练完 160 rounds 才在 seal 阶段因为额外文件失败。', 'Otherwise a 160-round run can fail only at seal time because of an unexpected extra file.')}</p></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="gdr-section" id="known-unknown" aria-labelledby="known-unknown-title">
    <p class="gdr-so-what">{t('所以呢？现在可以确认「GDR 很保守、DirectApply 真正移除了 task-score gate」，但还不能确认「DirectApply 更好」。', 'So what? We can establish that GDR was highly selective and that DirectApply truly removes the task-score gate. We cannot yet establish that DirectApply is better.')}</p>
    <h2 id="known-unknown-title">{t('Known / Unknown：我们现在知道什么 / 还不知道什么', 'Known / Unknown: what we know / what remains unknown')}</h2>
    <div class="gdr-known-unknown">
      <article class="is-known"><span>{t('KNOWN · 有证据', 'KNOWN · supported by evidence')}</span><ul>{known.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul></article>
      <article class="is-unknown"><span>{t('OPEN QUESTION · 等实验', 'OPEN QUESTION · pending experiment')}</span><ul>{unknown.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gdr-section" id="future" aria-labelledby="future-title">
    <p class="gdr-so-what">{t('所以呢？如果未来再做 GDR-v2，也必须作为新实验，而不是把今天的猜想写回旧结果。', 'So what? Any future GDR-v2 must be a new experiment, not a hypothesis retrofitted into today’s completed run.')}</p>
    <h2 id="future-title">GDR-v2 · {t('Future Work，只是概念', 'Future work, concept only')}</h2>
    <div class="gdr-future-flow" role="group" aria-label="Accept Probation Reject">
      <div><b>Accept</b><span>{t('证据足够时直接进入', 'enter when evidence is strong')}</span></div>
      <div class="is-probation"><b>Probation</b><span>{t('继续 H=3–5 rounds，再比较长期 trajectory', 'continue H=3–5 rounds, then compare trajectories')}</span></div>
      <div><b>Reject</b><span>{t('明确违反合同或长期证据差', 'clear contract violation or poor longer-horizon evidence')}</span></div>
    </div>
    <p>{t('可能研究：larger matched probe、paired comparison、confidence interval、trust region、delta scaling、carrier-specific attribution、challenger/incumbent branches。', 'Possible research directions: larger matched probes, paired comparison, confidence intervals, trust regions, delta scaling, carrier-specific attribution, and challenger/incumbent branches.')}</p>
    <strong class="gdr-concept-label">CONCEPT · NOT YET VALIDATED</strong>
  </section>

